{
  "slug": "discord-threads",
  "name": "Discord Threads",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Discord plugin for Claude Code with per-session thread routing. Fork of the official Discord plugin with added support for session-isolated threads and full permission context in messages.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `access` (Manage Discord channel access — approve pairings, edit allowlists, set DM/group policy), `configure` (Set up the Discord channel — save the bot token, configure session threads, and review access policy)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `discord`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install discord-threads@claude-community` from `AxiumFoundry/claude-discord-threads-plugin` (`plugins/discord-threads`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
